<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Future Champion | Personal Profile</title>

<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Montserrat:wght@400;700;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

<style>
*{
    margin:0;
    padding:0;
    box-sizing:border-box;
    font-family:'Montserrat',sans-serif;
}

body{
    background:#0b0b0b;
    color:white;
    overflow-x:hidden;
}

/* NAVBAR */
nav{
    position:fixed;
    width:100%;
    padding:20px 50px;
    display:flex;
    justify-content:space-between;
    align-items:center;
    background:rgba(0,0,0,0.6);
    backdrop-filter:blur(10px);
    z-index:1000;
}

nav h1{
    color:gold;
    font-weight:900;
    letter-spacing:2px;
}

nav a{
    color:white;
    text-decoration:none;
    margin-left:30px;
    transition:0.3s;
}

nav a:hover{
    color:gold;
}

/* HERO */
.hero{
    height:100vh;
    background:linear-gradient(rgba(0,0,0,0.6),rgba(0,0,0,0.9)),
    url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1508609349937-5ec4ae374ebf');
    background-size:cover;
    background-position:center;
    display:flex;
    flex-direction:column;
    justify-content:center;
    align-items:center;
    text-align:center;
    padding:20px;
}

.hero h2{
    font-size:60px;
    font-weight:900;
    color:gold;
}

.hero p{
    font-size:22px;
    margin:20px 0;
}

.btn{
    padding:12px 30px;
    border:2px solid gold;
    background:transparent;
    color:gold;
    font-weight:bold;
    cursor:pointer;
    transition:0.4s;
    margin:10px;
}

.btn:hover{
    background:gold;
    color:black;
}

/* ABOUT */
.section{
    padding:100px 10%;
    text-align:center;
}

.section h3{
    font-size:40px;
    color:gold;
    margin-bottom:20px;
}

.section p{
    max-width:800px;
    margin:auto;
    line-height:1.8;
    font-size:18px;
}

/* ACHIEVEMENTS */
.achievements{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(250px,1fr));
    gap:30px;
    margin-top:50px;
}

.card{
    background:#111;
    padding:30px;
    border-radius:15px;
    border:1px solid rgba(255,215,0,0.3);
    transition:0.4s;
}

.card:hover{
    transform:translateY(-10px);
    box-shadow:0 0 20px gold;
}

.card h4{
    color:gold;
    margin-bottom:10px;
}

/* FOOTER */
footer{
    background:black;
    padding:40px;
    text-align:center;
    color:gray;
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<nav>
    <h1>CHAMPION</h1>
    <div>
        <a href="#about">About</a>
        <a href="#achievements">Achievements</a>
        <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
    </div>
</nav>

<section class="hero">
    <h2>Small Age. Big Dreams. Golden Future.</h2>
    <p>Gold Medalist | Future Olympian</p>
    <div>
        <button class="btn">View Achievements</button>
        <button class="btn">Partner With Me</button>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="section" id="about">
    <h3>About The Champion</h3>
    <p>
        A young athlete with unstoppable passion and discipline.
        Winning gold at a young age is just the beginning.
        The dream is bigger — to represent the nation and stand on the Olympic podium.
    </p>
</section>

<section class="section" id="achievements">
    <h3>Achievements Wall</h3>

    <div class="achievements">
        <div class="card">
            <h4>🥇 State Championship</h4>
            <p>Gold Medal Winner - 2025</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <h4>🥈 District Level</h4>
            <p>Silver Medal - 2024</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <h4>🏅 Junior Nationals</h4>
            <p>Finalist - 2023</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="section" id="contact">
    <h3>Partner & Contact</h3>
    <p>
        For sponsorships, collaborations, and media inquiries,
        connect and be part of this golden journey.
    </p>
    <br>
    <button class="btn">Contact Now</button>
</section>

<footer>
    © 2026 Future Champion. All Rights Reserved.
</footer>

</body>
</html>

